# -*- Perl -*-
#***********************************************************************
#
# mimedefang-filter
#
# Example filter using Mail::MIMEDefang::LLM::Laya to get ham/spam/
# phishing verdicts from a resident Laya decision model
# (https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya), in addition to the usual
# SPF/DKIM/DMARC and SpamAssassin checks.
#
# Laya is additive here, not a replacement for SpamAssassin: its
# verdict only takes extra action (subject tagging, quarantine) on
# confident answers, and any failure to reach the Laya server is
# treated as "no opinion", falling back to SpamAssassin alone.
#
# Requires: Mail::MIMEDefang::LLM::Laya, and a running laya_server.py
# instance (see that module's SEE ALSO section).
#
